<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In DatedGPT: Preventing Lookahead Bias in Large Language Models with Time-Aware Pretraining" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Evaluation Result on Full Series of <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DatedGPT</span></span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
