<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"> <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DatedGPT</span>: Preventing Lookahead Bias in Large Language Models with Time-Aware Pretraining</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yutong Yan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
